    IF `the ground of the application is that an order directing that shares shall be subject to restrictions unfairly affects the rights of third parties in respect of the shares`
    THEN JUST TRUE
    ELSE NOTHING -- NOTHING-kind (limited by its own wording): "An application may be made to the court on the ground that": an application on another ground is not mentioned

-- src:10848 | (2) An application for an order under this section may be made by the company or by any person aggrieved.
